  "definition": "Wastewater Treatment Plant Owner Responsibilities",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-09-27",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 at part heading for Env-Wq 304) #10392, eff 8-1-13; ss by #13755, eff 9-27-23 (see Revision Note #2 at part heading for Env-Wq 304)",
